# Project Specification: samuTrain V2
- Core: OCR engine using Calamari 2.3.1 (source in lib/calamari).
- Database: Built-in sqlite3 (FOSS only).
- Structure: Logic in src/, Entry scripts in scripts/.
- Path Management: Always ensure src/ and project root are in sys.path.
- Constraints: Use 2-space indentation, no end-of-line comments, keep code dense.
- Current Status: 90% complete, moving to full web process with 64 test cases.
- NEVER downgrade TensorFlow below 2.15.0.
- Ignore "checkpoint version 2" errors by performing a training cycle to upgrade the model.

# Project Rules

## Core Principles
- **No Vibe Coding:** Do not rewrite existing logic unless explicitly asked. Focus on incremental improvements.
- **Clean Architecture:** Keep the DAO pattern in `src/db.py`. Do not mix SQL with API logic in `src/main.py`.
- **Decoupling:** `src/main.py` (FastAPI) should never depend on `calamari_ocr`. Only `src/bridge.py` handles OCR logic.

## Environment & Shell (Critical)
- **PowerShell 5.1 Only:** NEVER use `&&` or `||` in terminal commands. Use `;` for sequencing or run commands separately.
- **Editable Libs:** Always use `pip install -e lib/calamari` if Calamari dependencies are missing.
- **Python Version:** Always use Python 3.10.14 (Virtual Environment is in `venv_310` folder) for terminal commands.
- **Environment:** The project now uses an editable install of Calamari. Any changes in lib/calamari will take effect immediately. Do not attempt to re-install from PyPI.

## Coding Standards
- **Indentation:** Use 2 spaces strictly.
- **Comments:** Use English only. No comments at the end of lines.
- **Encoding:** Always use `encoding='utf-8'` when reading/writing `.gt.txt` or any text files.

## Project Structure (Do Not Deviate)
- `src/`: All Python logic.
- `lib/`: Submodules only (calamari, samuLearnUI.ts).
- `data/`: All OCR images and .gt.txt files. gitignored.
- `.old/`: Move replaced files here instead of deleting them.
- `scripts/`: Entry scripts and utilities, including migration and once-run scripts too

## Specific Fixes
- **Calamari Version:** If `__version__` is missing from `calamari_ocr`, use the monkey-patch in `src/bridge.py` or manually edit `lib/calamari/calamari_ocr/__init__.py`.
- **Static Assets:** The backend mounts `data/` to `/static`. Ensure the API returns `/static/filename.png` for UI compatibility.

## Calamari CLI Parameters
- **Reference:** See `.windsurf/skills/calamari-expert/SKILL.md` for complete PAIArgumentParser documentation.
- **Parameter Structure:** Use flattened arguments for predict.py (`--checkpoint`) vs nested for train.py (`--trainer.checkpoint`).
- **Avoid UnknownArgumentError:** Always check `flat=True/False` mode before constructing argument lists.

